
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Seers.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Seers.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"lnifkq","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777149410649,"size":1934,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"lnifkq"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,19],"#Culture - The Seers":[21,22],"#Young male oracles who serve as conduits for Althena's will.":[23,30],"#Young male oracles who serve as conduits for Althena's will.#{1}":[24,30]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["seer","seers","oracle","prophet","hallucinogen"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What is this?**  \nThe Seers are young male oracles, aged 10–20, trained by the church to channel Althena’s will. Selected from any social class, they enter a hallucinogenic trance under a priestess’s supervision; she interprets their cryptic words for supplicants seeking guidance.\n\n**When should this be selected?**  \n- When a character seeks divine guidance from Althena.  \n- When the story involves church rituals, oracles, or prophecy.  \n- When describing Seer training, selection, or retirement.  \n- When a Seer becomes a spouse post-service (they are prized, docile husbands for aristocracy).\n\n**Key Relationships**  \n- **Althena** (the feminine deity they serve).  \n- **Priestesses** (administer the substance & interpret Seer’s words).  \n- **Supplicants** (clients receiving guidance).  \n- **Aristocratic families** (Seers marry into them after age 20; expected to be passive, non-ambitious, and wise)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Seers.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"qvytjb","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Seers.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,19],"size":1133,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
